# Sanity

- Apartment inventory and photography live in Sanity — do not hardcode listings in React.
- Localize user-facing CMS strings (vi/en) via Sanity locale fields or parallel fields; document the chosen pattern in schemas.
- Images: `@sanity/image-url` + explicit width/quality; never raw unbounded asset URLs in UI.
- Keep schemas under `sanity/schemaTypes/` (or project equivalent); export from a single index.
- Studio must support: apartments, site settings (phone, Zalo, email), home page content.
- Price fields are display strings for inquiry, not payment amounts.
